    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A gufo:Type whose instances are abstract individuals.

Instances of gufo:AbstractIndividualType are subclasses of gufo:AbstractIndividual.

Examples include the types "NaturalNumber", "Set", "Proposition".</rdfs:comment>
