  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPoint">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">hasBeginPoint</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#ConcreteEntity"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPointInXSDDate"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPointInXSDDateTimeStamp"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#Instant"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Identifies the begin point for a gufo:ConcreteIndividual, in the case in which time instants are reified. 

In the case of endurants, this identifies the time point when the endurant comes into existence. In the case of events, this identifies the time point when the event starts to take place. In the case of situation, this identifies the time point when the situation begins to hold.

If time instants are not reified, use gufo:hasBeginPointInXSDDate or gufo:hasBeginPointInXSDDateTimeStamp.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="N562141daacf94ad1be282af2997a9770">
