  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#unitCentury">
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="es">siglo</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="kr">한 세기</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ar">قرن واحد</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="pl">stulecie</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">century</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">siècle</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ja">一世紀</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Jahrhundert</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="zh">一个世纪</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="nl">eeuw</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ru">век</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="pt">século</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">secolo</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Century (unit of temporal duration)</rdfs:label>
    <time:years rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">100</time:years>
    <time:weeks rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:weeks>
    <time:seconds rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:seconds>
    <time:days rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:days>
    <time:hours rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:hours>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalUnit"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <time:months rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:months>
    <time:minutes rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</time:minutes>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPointInXSDDateTimeStamp">
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPoint"/>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#hasBeginPointInXSDDate"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Determines the begin point for a gufo:ConcreteIndividual, using a xsd:dateTimeStamp literal.

In the case of endurants, gufo:hasBeginPointInXSDDateTimeStamp determines the time point when the endurant comes into existence. In the case of events, this data property determines the time point when the event starts to take place. In the case of situation, it determines the time point when the situation begins to hold.

Use gufo:hasBeginPoint instead when temporal entities are reified.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">hasBeginPointInXSDDateTimeStamp</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#ConcreteEntity"/>
  </rdf:Description>
