  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/def/propaphen#hasSTValidPath">
    <rdfs:label>Has Spatial-Temporal Valid Path</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Represents a valid spatial-temporal path between two observations.


I.e. From the same phen:PhenomenonOccurrence "Hurricane in France on 2019", we may have different phen:Observations like "Hurricane observed in Rouen on November,2019" and "Hurricane observed in Paris on December,2019". We may say that there is a possibility that the Hurricane went from Rouen to Paris, so there is a valid spatial-temporal path between the first and the second observation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/def/propaphen#Observation"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AsymmetricProperty"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/def/propaphen#Observation"/>
  </rdf:Description>
