  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#externallyDependsOn">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#Endurant"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#ExtrinsicMode"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Identifies a gufo:Endurant on which the gufo:ExtrinsicMode depends.

For example, John's duty to return the book he borrowed from Mary (a gufo:ExtrinsicMode) depends externally on Mary.

The identifed gufo:Endurant should  be external to the bearer of the extrinsic mode (see Guizzardi, 2005, p. 239). In other words, the identified endurant should not be a part or an intrisic aspect of the bearer of the extrinsic mode.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">externallyDependsOn</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#IrreflexiveProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
