  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/def/propaphen#hasSpatialObject">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#SpatialObject"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Relies a gufo:Object to parts of it's geo:SpatialObject.

I.e. A gufo:Object "Country" could be related to one geo:SpatialObject that delimits its entire zone, or it could be related to many geo:SpatialObjects for each gufo:Object "City" that forms the "Country".</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#Object"/>
    <rdfs:label>Has Spatial Object</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
