    <rdfs:comment>Relates the phen:Presence of multiple gufo:Individuals in a phen:Observation.

I.e. "Vacines", "Pantients of COVID-19" and "Pneumonia" gufo:Indifiduals were present (phen:Presence) on december of 2020 in the phen:Observation "Spread of COVID-19 in Paris on december of 2020".</rdfs:comment>
