    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A gufo:EndurantType that is both non-sortal and rigid. It captures essential properties that apply to instances of different kinds.

For example, "PhysicalObject" may be considered a gufo:Category, encompassing objects such as cars, planets, trees. "Agent" may be a gufo:Category that classifies both people and organizations.</rdfs:comment>
